The files under src/sdl3/raw/, the file src/sdl3/consts.clj and the files
under src/sdl3/consts/ are generated by tools/gen.clj from the header files
of Simple DirectMedia Layer (SDL3) and of its companion libraries SDL_ttf,
SDL_image, SDL_mixer and SDL_net, and reproduce their function signatures,
type layouts, enumeration names and values, and hint and property strings.
They are:

  Simple DirectMedia Layer
  Copyright (C) 1997-2026 Sam Lantinga <slouken@libsdl.org>

  SDL_ttf
  Copyright (C) 2001-2025 Sam Lantinga <slouken@libsdl.org>

  SDL_image
  Copyright (C) 1997-2026 Sam Lantinga <slouken@libsdl.org>

  SDL_mixer
  Copyright (C) 1997-2026 Sam Lantinga <slouken@libsdl.org>

  SDL_net
  Copyright (C) 1997-2026 Sam Lantinga <slouken@libsdl.org>

and are distributed under the same zlib license as above; SDL's notice is
in SDL_copying.h of the SDL source distribution, and each companion
library carries the same notice in its headers. The generated files
are altered from the headers by construction and are marked as
generated at the top of each file.
